-- title:
--   Finite layers of a valuation ring algebraic over a DVR
-- statement:
--   Let $L$ be a field of characteristic zero and $A \subseteq L$ a valuation subring, with $\mathrm{residue}$ denoting the reduction map of the local ring $A$ onto its residue field. Let $C' \subseteq L$ be a subring all of whose elements lie in $A$, which is a domain and a discrete valuation ring, and let $\varpi' \in C'$ be irreducible and such that, for $d \in C'$, the residue of $d$ in $A$ vanishes exactly when $d \in \varpi' C'$. Assume every element of $A$ is algebraic over $C'$, and let $S$ be a finite subset of $L$ contained in $A$. Then there are a subring $C'' \subseteq L$ which is a domain and a discrete valuation ring, an element $\varpi'' \in C''$, a natural number $e$, and a subring $R \subseteq L$, with $C' \le C''$, $C' \le R$ and $C'' \subseteq A$, such that: $S \subseteq C''$; $C''$ consists exactly of the elements of $A$ lying in the subfield of $L$ generated by $C' \cup S$; $\varpi''$ is irreducible and, for $d \in C''$, the residue of $d$ in $A$ vanishes exactly when $d \in \varpi'' C''$; $e \ge 1$ and $\varpi' = v\,(\varpi'')^{e}$ in $L$ for some $v$ with $v, v^{-1} \in C''$; and $R \le C''$ with $R$ finite as a module over $C'$ for the algebra structure given by the inclusion, every $c \in C''$ being of the form $c s = r$ with $r, s \in R$, $s \ne 0$ and $s^{-1} \in C''$.
--
--   This is the statement that the finite layers $A \cap \operatorname{Frac}(C')(S)$ of a valuation ring $A$ algebraic over a discrete valuation ring $C'$ are again discrete valuation rings, obtained by Krull–Akizuki, together with the bookkeeping needed later: the new uniformiser is detected by the residue map of $A$, it divides the old one with ramification index $e \ge 1$, and the layer is a localisation of a module-finite $C'$-subalgebra. It is used in the analysis of node rings and nodal charts, where valuation rings of function fields are approximated by their finitely generated layers.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ValuationSubring_exists_layer_isDiscreteValuationRing_of_finite_of_isAlgebraic_of_irreducible.lean

import Mathlib

